  doc_privacy_web:'<h1 class="pg">Privacy policy</h1><p>Barik collects as little as possible about you — only what the account cannot work without.</p><h2>Your account</h2><p>If you create an account, we store your email address, nickname, sign-up and last sign-in dates and, if you subscribe, the subscription status, term and your customer and subscription IDs at Paddle. There is no password: a one-time code is sent to your email and only its hash is kept. Your email is used only for sign-in codes, never for newsletters. You can delete the account with all of this data using the "Delete account" button.</p><h2>What stays on your device</h2><p>Learning progress, settings and flagged words are stored only in your browser on your device and are not sent to the server. Signing in sets one technical cookie — no advertising, no tracking.</p><h2>Payments</h2><p>The subscription is sold and payments are processed by Paddle (paddle.com), our merchant of record. Payment details are entered in the Paddle window and are never available to us. Paddle privacy policy: paddle.com/legal/privacy.</p><h2>Advertising and analytics</h2><p>None. The site uses no third-party counters; an external script is loaded only at checkout — the Paddle window.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>Questions about your data — to the address listed on barik.am.</p>',
  doc_terms_web:'<h1 class="pg">Terms of use</h1><p>Level A1 and the alphabet are free; the Barik Premium subscription unlocks levels A2–C2. Until payments are connected, everything on the site is open.</p><h2>Subscription</h2><p>You subscribe monthly or yearly in your account. Payments are handled by Paddle, the merchant of record: it issues the receipt and handles taxes. The subscription renews automatically until you cancel it: "Account" → "Manage subscription"; access remains until the end of the paid period. Refunds follow Paddle rules (paddle.com/legal/checkout-buyer-terms).</p><h2>Account</h2><p>One account per person. A nickname must not be offensive or impersonate someone else — we may change such a nickname.</p><h2>Content</h2><p>The dictionary is made for learning Eastern Armenian in reformed spelling. We try to avoid mistakes; if you find one, flag the word with the "Mistake in this word?" button. The audio is a synthetic voice by Microsoft Azure.</p><h2>Rights</h2><p>Barik’s learning materials (lessons, scenes, translations, exercises, pictures, software) are © Barik and may not be copied without permission. Dictionary data from Wiktionary, with our changes, is under CC BY-SA 4.0; the classic texts are in the public domain; details are in “Sources and licences”.</p>',
  pwLegal:'The subscription renews automatically until you cancel it. Cancel any time in Google Play → Payments & subscriptions → Subscriptions. Payment is charged to your Google Play account when you confirm the purchase.',
